    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "RIO DE JANEIRO\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch\nBourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum\nPremium Beer\nMenus\nFresh Fruit Supreme\nChilled seasonal fresh fruits\nOmelette Luxe\nA delicate omelette with your choice of breakfast meats:\nlamb chops, petit filet steak or sausages\nGrills Garni\nLamb chops, petit filet steak or sausages garnished with\nbroiled tomato half and grilled mushrooms\nCoffee\nPotatoes Maison\nGarden Vegetables\nSelected Fruits\nDessert\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nTea",
      "Coffee\nSelected Fruits\nDessert\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nTea\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nAmaretto di Saronno\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nContreau\nBénédictine\n393K815",
      "Dong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nRIO DE JANEIRO is the jewel of South America. Nowhere in the world is a citv blessed with so much\nnatural beauty. Corcovado Mountain, crowned by the imposing statue of Christ the Redeemer, and\nSugar Loaf, overlooking Guanabara Bay and the city lights below, are equally breathtaking sights.\nRio is also renowned for its magnificent beaches. Gavea Beach, the site of the luxurious\nInter-Continental-Rio, and Copacabana Beach, with its mosaic walks, are world famous. Pan Am\nserves Rio daily from New York Washington, Miami, San Francisco, Los Angeles, and Houston.\nØPAN AM.\n2007.054.018"
    ],
